  "text": "Can I sit across an Italian owner and convince them that I'm the right buyer The main reason why I'm here in Europe is to really understand this ecosystem better Most of our clients have been in US one in Australia and now in India It's a very untapped market compared to the US which is so saturated with private equity firms And there are so many family businesses so many sectors that are fragmented What have I learned in the last two weeks The thing that I'd value the most is that real-time feedback on my thesis right The type of business I want to buy um the drawback we're very young The largest deal that we've done due diligence on was around 30 million dollars I think what it's really going to come down to now is me choosing the right business to buy Because that's honestly the hardest part They don't want to just sell to a private equity firm I do believe I'm the right buyer",
